The adapted material has been modified for Pi's Agent Skills and package
formats. Claude-specific plugin paths, executable agent/hook declarations, and
connector declarations are not included. Protected-leave agent knowhow is
adapted into on-demand Skill references without requiring an agent runtime.
The external general DOCX Skill is referenced, not redistributed; its separate
license is not replaced by this package's license.

The Markdown document-history implementation and legal-document-edit workflow
are original Pi Legal contributions. Aider and Manubot are cited as design
references only; their implementation code is not redistributed.
